@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### API liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### MongoDB readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health/ready
Accept: application/json

### Consistent unknown-route response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/does-not-exist
Accept: application/json

### Login: supply loginIdentifier/loginPassword through your REST client's private environment.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "{{loginIdentifier}}",
  "password": "{{loginPassword}}"
}

### Current authenticated user: provide accessToken privately; never commit real credentials/tokens.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Backoffice: pending prosumers (private token/environment variables required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/prosumers?status=PENDING&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Backoffice: approve the selected user
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Prosumer: request own deactivation
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/prosumers/me/deactivation-request
Authorization: Bearer {{prosumerAccessToken}}

### Backoffice: reactivate a deactivated prosumer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/prosumers/{{prosumerNic}}/activate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Backoffice: create a solar station (private token/environment variables required)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationCode": "COLOMBO-01",
  "name": "Colombo Solar Station",
  "address": "Colombo, Sri Lanka",
  "latitude": 6.9271,
  "longitude": 79.8612,
  "capacityKWh": 250,
  "availableBatterySlots": 12,
  "status": "ACTIVE",
  "operatingSchedule": {
    "timeZoneId": "Asia/Colombo",
    "weeklyPeriods": [
      { "day": "Monday", "openMinuteOfDay": 480, "closeMinuteOfDay": 1080 }
    ]
  }
}

### Authenticated: find nearby active stations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/nearby?latitude=6.9271&longitude=79.8612&radiusKm=10&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Authenticated: list slots for a station
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/{{stationId}}/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Backoffice: create an energy booking slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/stations/{{stationId}}/slots
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-09-20T08:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-20T09:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 25,
  "availableCapacity": 25,
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Backoffice: update a slot
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/slots/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-09-20T08:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-09-20T09:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 25,
  "availableCapacity": 25,
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### Backoffice: cancel a slot (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/slots/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
